## Must-fix 1 — recursive-closure tests do not move

The implementation *is* recursive (`pending.append` at `ledger_fold.py:228` and `:239`). The tests are not. `test_missing_symbol_closure` and `test_dimension_closure` (`test_ledger_fold.py:125–158`) only walk **one** edge. Ablating the copy to one-level-only (do not enqueue targets) leaves **all 9 tests PASS**.

**Ablation:** `/tmp/ledger_fold_review/ablate_nonrecursive/ledger_fold.py`  
**Status diff:** `/tmp/ledger_fold_review/probes/ablation_status_diff.txt`

