Full ablated run: `/tmp/ledger_fold_review/ablate_nonrecursive/test_stdout.txt`.

A two-deep missing dependency is an under-export the **broken** copy accepts and the real module catches. Script `/tmp/ledger_fold_review/probes/probe_recursion_vs_tests.py`, stdout `/tmp/ledger_fold_review/probes/probe_recursion_vs_tests_stdout.txt`:

